WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:03.120
- What, are you recreating
the Sistine Chapel

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:03.970
in this boy's room?

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.150
- Not bad, right?

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.074
- You should be knee deep
in that sofa in there

00:00:07.074 --> 00:00:08.763
with some Graeter's Ice Cream.

00:00:08.763 --> 00:00:11.270
(laughing)

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.103
Don't move.

00:00:14.308 --> 00:00:15.348
(grunts in pain)

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.515
(beeping)

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.450
Baby, where are you?

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.630
- [Kidnapper] Hello Paul.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.074
- What do you want?

00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:25.278
(car indicator clicking)

00:00:25.278 --> 00:00:26.538
(police sirens)

00:00:26.538 --> 00:00:28.900
- [Kidnapper] Last night a man
was taken to your hospital.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.200
I need you to get him out.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.580
- Wherever he goes, I go.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.027
- Whatever you say, officer.

00:00:35.027 --> 00:00:37.694
(intense music)

00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:41.460
(beeping)

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:42.293
- What's happening?

00:00:42.293 --> 00:00:43.189
- His heart.

00:00:43.189 --> 00:00:44.809
Get me the defibrillator!

00:00:44.809 --> 00:00:46.809
(shock)

00:00:50.763 --> 00:00:52.200
(upbeat, intriguing music)

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.670
- You don't want to get
involved in this hole.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.830
Let me handle it.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.050
- Who took my wife?

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:57.070
- Dirty cops.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.653
(loading guns)

00:01:00.941 --> 00:01:01.820
- Where are you going?

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.810
- I'm going to kill 'em.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:05.142
All of them.

00:01:05.142 --> 00:01:07.810
♪ Good cop, good cop,
rollin' with that bad cop ♪

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.615
- Cops want you dead, homie.

00:01:09.615 --> 00:01:12.452
(gun shots)

00:01:12.452 --> 00:01:13.285
(car revs)

00:01:13.285 --> 00:01:14.663
♪ Come after cuffs yeah ♪

00:01:14.663 --> 00:01:15.764
♪ Knock off the rust ♪

00:01:15.764 --> 00:01:18.214
♪ Throw my hands up,
you still wanna bust ♪

00:01:18.214 --> 00:01:19.768
♪ The Trojan horse, is full ♪

00:01:19.768 --> 00:01:21.983
- [Criminal] Lose the tail.

00:01:21.983 --> 00:01:24.940
- This some real Grand Theft Auto shit.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:25.820
- The fuck is that?

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:26.653
- It's a video game.

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:27.850
- I'm a fucking grown-up, man.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:29.120
I don't play video games.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.200
- Yeah, well maybe you should try

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.660
to help you with your aggression.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:33.493
- Everybody's always saying,

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:34.890
"I'll do anything for my family."

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:36.620
This is as fucking anything as it gets.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.840
- Bring him to us and
you'll get your wife back.

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.351
You got an hour.

00:01:40.351 --> 00:01:41.530
(gun shot)

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.490
- You're going to jail.

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:44.120
- You just day stupid shit all the time.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.701
If I'm going to jail
you're coming with me, pal.

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:48.685
(fighting)

00:01:48.685 --> 00:01:51.251
♪ You know that mean
cop might need a detox ♪

00:01:51.251 --> 00:01:53.893
♪ Motherfucker' tryna
blow me out my Reebox ♪

00:01:53.893 --> 00:01:58.240
♪ But I swing like Jack
and the Beanstalk ♪

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.690
- I want it buffed and
polished, and the rims detailed.

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:02.390
- Can you get the fuck
out of the car please?

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.200
- I have pepper spray in my purse.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.550
- I have a gun in my pants.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:09.340
- What kind of fucking car wash is this?

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.665
♪ Bad cop, where's your humanity? ♪

00:02:11.665 --> 00:02:15.998
♪ Good cop, is that just a fantasy? ♪

